// Act 3 - Hangar 18, Administration, Sub-Level 0
// ==============================================

title: Hangar18_Arrival
tags: act3, hangar18, arrival
---
<<SetZone "Hangar18">>
<<SetTimeline "present">>

Astra: <<if $trust < 9>>
    [Projection shimmers with gravity distortion]
    "Hangar 18. Stasis... bay. Extraction... pod. Gravity... unstable."
    "Gravity Anchor... here. Final organ. Wall run. Gravity... shift."
<<else>>
    "Hangar 18. Two Vista Nodes. Stasis Bay... Extraction Pod."
    "Gravity Calibration... and Stasis Recovery. Puzzles... linked."
<</if>>

<<if not HasVisitedVistaNode "Hangar18_StasisBay">>
    Astra: "Stasis Bay. First node. Gravity Calibration puzzle."
    "Four anchor emitters. Tetrahedral... pattern. Stabilize... field."
<<else>>
    Astra: "Stasis Bay... complete. Extraction Pod... awaits."
<</if>>

-> Choice_Hangar18
===

title: Choice_Hangar18
---
+ [Approach Stasis Bay] -> Node_Hangar18_StasisBay_Approach
+ [Approach Extraction Pod] -> Node_Hangar18_ExtractionPod_Approach
+ "Who is in stasis?" -> Dialogue_StasisCrew
+ "Tell me about the Gravity Anchor." -> Dialogue_GravityAnchor
+ "Corwin... he's here, isn't he?" -> Dialogue_CorwinHangar
+ [Fast Travel] -> Command_ShowJournal_Map
===

title: Dialogue_StasisCrew
---
Astra: "1957. Meltdown survivors. Three... crew members."
"Phased... not dead. Suspended... in stasis. Waiting."
"Thorne... placed them here. Hoped... for rescue."
"Reyes... guarded them. Died... 1962. Fighting... something."
"Revive them... Gravity Anchor... required. Chrono-resonance... frequency."

-> Choice_Hangar18
===

title: Dialogue_GravityAnchor
---
Astra: "Gravity Anchor... fourth organ. Reality... anchor. Wall run. Gravity... shift."
"Walk... walls. Ceiling. Fall... up. Reverse... gravity."
"In past... reach... Extraction Pod launch. In present... traverse... Sub-Level 0."
"Chronos Core... time. Neural Loom... memory. Void Sail... freedom."
"Gravity Anchor... *agency*. Choose... your direction."

-> Choice_Hangar18
===

title: Dialogue_CorwinHangar
---
Astra: "Corwin... here. 1957. Stasis Bay. He... watches."
"1962. Extraction Pod. He... launches. Or... stops."
"All timelines... he sees. All choices... he knows."
"He waits... for you. For *us*. The Navigator... and the Ship."
"Trust... him? The choice... determines... the ending."

-> Choice_Hangar18
===

title: Node_Hangar18_StasisBay_Approach
---
<<MarkVistaNodeVisited "Hangar18_StasisBay">>
Astra: "Stasis Bay. Gravity field... unstable. Four emitters."
"Tetrahedral pattern. Target stability... 95%."

-> Phase_Shift_Hangar18_StasisBay
===

title: Phase_Shift_Hangar18_StasisBay
---
<<TriggerPhaseShift "Hangar18_StasisBay">>
<<SetTimeline "past">>
<<PlaySequence "LS_PhaseShift_Hangar18_StasisBay">>

Astra: "1957. Post-meltdown. Gravity field... collapsing."
"Puzzle: **Gravity Anchor Calibration**. Stabilize... emitters."
"[Hold] each emitter. Pattern... tetrahedral. Phase lock... required."

<<SetActivePuzzle "Hangar18_GravityCalibration">>

-> Puzzle_GravityCalibration_Start
===

title: Puzzle_GravityCalibration_Start
---
Astra: "[Hold] Emitter 1. Base vertex. Gravity... down."
"[Hold] Emitter 2. Vertex. Gravity... 109.5° offset."
"[Hold] Emitter 3. Vertex. Gravity... 109.5° offset."
"[Hold] Emitter 4. Apex. Gravity... up."
"Simultaneous... phase lock. Astra... assists."

<<command RevealClue "CLUE_GRAVITY_FIELD">>

Corwin: [At emitter console]
"Gravity Anchor... the most dangerous organ. Reality... bends."
"Thorne feared it. Reyes... respected it. I... *use* it."
"Stabilize... the field. Or... watch it tear... this facility apart."

-> Puzzle_GravityCalibration_Emitters
===

title: Puzzle_GravityCalibration_Emitters
---
Astra: "Emitters 1-3... synchronized. Emitter 4... apex. Final."
"[Hold] at Apex. Phase lock... complete. Field... stable."

// Player executes Hold at Emitter 4
<<command RevealClue "CLUE_EXTRACTION_TRAJECTORY">>

Astra: "Field... stable. Extraction Pod... launch sequence... ready."
"Angle: 42.5°. Velocity: 1200. Gravity assist... engaged."
"Command me: [Follow] pod trajectory. Guide... launch."

-> Puzzle_GravityCalibration_Extraction
===

title: Puzzle_GravityCalibration_Extraction
---
Astra: "[Follow] engaged. Tracking... pod. Gravity assist... active."
"Trajectory... nominal. Window... 2.0 seconds. Adjust... if needed."

// Player executes Follow - Astra guides pod
<<command RevealClue "CLUE_ANCHOR_SYNC">>

Astra: "Pod... launched. Gravity Anchor... calibrated. But... synchronization... required."
"Both nodes. Stasis Bay... and Extraction Pod. Phase lock... across... distance."
"Command me: [Hold] at Extraction Pod. You... [Hold] at Stasis Bay."
"Simultaneous. Trust... absolute."

-> Phase_Shift_Hangar18_ExtractionPod
===

title: Phase_Shift_Hangar18_ExtractionPod
---
<<TriggerPhaseShift "Hangar18_ExtractionPod">>
<<SetTimeline "past">>
<<PlaySequence "LS_PhaseShift_Hangar18_ExtractionPod">>

Astra: "Extraction Pod. 1957. Launch... successful. Or... not."
"Puzzle: **Anchor Synchronization**. Phase lock... both nodes."
"[Hold] at Pod console. Astra... [Hold] at Stasis Bay console."
"Window... 0.5 seconds. Across... facility."

-> Puzzle_AnchorSync_Execute
===

title: Puzzle_AnchorSync_Execute
---
Astra: "Ready... Navigator. On my mark."
"Three... two... one... *mark*."

// Simultaneous Hold at both nodes

Corwin: [At Pod console]
"Simultaneous phase lock... across 2 kilometers. Impressive."
"The Anchor... binds spacetime. Not just... gravity."
"Your ship... the *Chronos*. It *is* an Anchor. Planetary... scale."
"You're not just... restoring organs. You're... *rebuilding a ship*."

-> Puzzle_AnchorSync_Result
===

title: Puzzle_AnchorSync_Result
---
<<if $active_puzzle_success>>
    Astra: "Synchronized. Gravity Anchor... stable. Reality... anchored."
    "Present... changed. Gravity... stable. Platform... extended."
    
    <<MarkPuzzleSolved "Hangar18_GravityCalibration">>
    <<AddResonance 300>>
    <<AddMemoryFragment "Fragment_10">>
    <<AddMemoryFragment "Fragment_11">>
    <<AddTrust 2>>
    <<GrantOrgan "GravityAnchor">>
    <<SetAstraVisualState "unity">>
    
    Astra: "GRAVITY ANCHOR RESTORED."
    "Wall run... unlocked. Gravity shift... unlocked. Reality... yours."
    "All four organs... restored. Sub-Level 0... accessible."
    
    <<SetEndingFlag "gravity_anchor_restored" true>>
    <<UnlockFastTravel "Administration">>
    <<UnlockFastTravel "SubLevel0">>
    
    -> Phase_Shift_Return_Hangar18_ExtractionPod
<<else>>
    Astra: "Failed. Phase lock... lost. Gravity... destabilizing."
    "Try again. Trust... the anchor."
    
    -> Puzzle_AnchorSync_Execute
<</if>
===

title: Phase_Shift_Return_Hangar18_ExtractionPod
---
<<TriggerPhaseShift "Hangar18_ExtractionPod">>
<<SetTimeline "present">>
<<PlaySequence "LS_PhaseShift_Hangar18_ExtractionPod_Return">>

Astra: "Present... Hangar 18 stable. Gravity... anchored."
"Stasis Recovery... next. Revive... the crew."
"Then... Administration. Director's Authorization."
"Sub-Level 0... awaits. The synthesis... begins."

-> Choice_Hangar18
===

title: Node_Hangar18_ExtractionPod_Approach
---
<<MarkVistaNodeVisited "Hangar18_ExtractionPod">>
<<if not HasSolvedPuzzle "Hangar18_GravityCalibration">>
    Astra: "Extraction Pod. Stasis Recovery. But... Gravity Calibration... incomplete."
    "Complete... Stasis Bay first. Anchor... before revival."
    -> Choice_Hangar18
<<else>>
    Astra: "Extraction Pod. Stasis Recovery Protocol. Three pods. Chrono-resonance."
    "Simultaneous... revival. Neural Loom... frequency. Chronos Core... timing."
    -> Phase_Shift_Hangar18_StasisRecovery
<</if>
===

title: Phase_Shift_Hangar18_StasisRecovery
---
<<TriggerPhaseShift "Hangar18_ExtractionPod">>
<<SetTimeline "past">>
<<PlaySequence "LS_PhaseShift_Hangar18_ExtractionPod">>

Astra: "1957. Stasis pods... viable. Revival... possible."
"Puzzle: **Stasis Recovery Protocol**. Three pods. Simultaneous."
"Frequency... Chronos Core. Sequence... Neural Loom. Power... Void Sail."

<<SetActivePuzzle "Hangar18_StasisRecovery">>

-> Puzzle_StasisRecovery_Start
===

title: Puzzle_StasisRecovery_Start
---
Astra: "[Scan] Pod 1. Vitals... stable. Neural... intact."
"[Scan] Pod 2. Vitals... stable. Neural... intact."
"[Scan] Pod 3. Vitals... critical. Neural... fragmented."
"Command me: [Hold] at each pod. Chrono-resonance... simultaneous."
"All four organs... engaged. Trust... total."

<<command RevealClue "CLUE_STASIS_VITALS">>

Corwin: [Observing]
"Reviving... the lost. Thorne's work... completed. By *you*."
"Subject 3... Thorne's assistant. Subject 7... Reyes's protégé."
"Subject 12... *my* choice. The one... I couldn't save."
"Watch... closely. This... changes things."

-> Puzzle_StasisRecovery_Execute
===

title: Puzzle_StasisRecovery_Execute
---
Astra: "Chronos Core... time dilation. Neural Loom... memory bridge."
"Void Sail... dimensional bridge. Gravity Anchor... reality anchor."
"Four organs... one resonance. Revival... initiating."
"[Hold] Pod 1. [Hold] Pod 2. [Hold] Pod 3. Simultaneous."

// Player and Astra Hold at all three pods simultaneously

-> Puzzle_StasisRecovery_Complete
===

title: Puzzle_StasisRecovery_Complete
---
Astra: "Revival... complete. Crew... awake. Testimony... recorded."
"Present... changed. Crew testimony... unlocked. Administration... path... clear."

<<MarkPuzzleSolved "Hangar18_StasisRecovery">>
<<AddResonance 250>>
<<AddMemoryFragment "Fragment_12">>
<<AddTrust 1>>
<<SetAstraVisualState "memory">>

Astra: "Final memory fragment... recovered. All 12... collected."
"Crew... testify. Corwin's... choices. Thorne's... sacrifice. Reyes's... duty."
"Trust... maximum. Memory... complete."
"Sub-Level 0... the synthesis... awaits."

<<SetEndingFlag "stasis_crew_revived" true>>

-> Phase_Shift_Return_Hangar18_StasisRecovery
===

title: Phase_Shift_Return_Hangar18_StasisRecovery
---
<<TriggerPhaseShift "Hangar18_ExtractionPod">>
<<SetTimeline "present">>
<<PlaySequence "LS_PhaseShift_Hangar18_ExtractionPod_Return">>

Astra: "Present... crew revived. Testimony... in journal."
"Four organs. Twelve fragments. Trust... high."
"Administration... Director's Authorization. Then... Sub-Level 0."
"Navigator... the end... begins."

-> Choice_Hangar18
===